{
  "family": "Bubbly mobile game show in C major pentatonic: a soft celesta bell, a bright glockenspiel, a round synth pluck and a juicy bubble pop, each tuned onto C major pentatonic in a fixed register and layered into rising figures, plus a split-flap flick, a coin cascade, a twinkle and an airy swoosh for texture. Bright, round and rewarding; dry, short, never casino, never harsh.",
